CodeArts2API Panel

Based on CodeArts2API by 2951461586 and its contributors:
https://github.com/2951461586/CodeArts2API
Base revision: c11aa7bba77d148ed04dec2c6a67b74cb8732293
The inherited implementation is licensed under Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE).

This distribution modifies the base project's panel, account routing,
authentication, usage accounting, protocol adapters and client integration.
Detailed changes and validation are recorded in the corresponding Git commits.

AI-assisted development: OpenAI ChatGPT / Codex was used for implementation,
debugging, testing and documentation. This attribution does not imply OpenAI
company maintenance, sponsorship or endorsement. See CONTRIBUTORS.md.

The account-pool product design was inspired by linguo2625469/workbuddy2api-panel:
https://github.com/linguo2625469/workbuddy2api-panel
The panel color tokens and compact visual presentation also adapt this project's
design. Its MIT license and copyright notices are in LICENSE.workbuddy.

This is an independent community project, not a Huawei product.

